units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.52 origin 0 0 0 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region unitcell block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box 1 unitcell
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 10 10 10
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
velocity all create 600 4928459 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol lx ly lz
thermo_modify flush yes norm no lost error
run_style verlet
reset_timestep 0
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1
run 220000
